From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: meta <heavygee@oos-linux.in.lockhouse>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 13:25:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(soup): drop orphan importHistory from #991 spawnSession
 mocks

Companion to heal 53 (parked import cluster signature). The #991 Cursor ACP
resume tests still mocked spawnSession with an `_importHistory?: boolean`
slot, so after heal 53 removed that param from the real signature the mock
captured `existingSessionId` as undefined and the two tests failed verify.

Verified: those two sessionModel tests pass with this heal applied.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
 hub/src/sync/sessionModel.test.ts | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hub/src/sync/sessionModel.test.ts b/hub/src/sync/sessionModel.test.ts
index babb1e16c..db621e3a3 100644
--- a/hub/src/sync/sessionModel.test.ts
+++ b/hub/src/sync/sessionModel.test.ts
@@ -1292,7 +1292,6 @@ describe('session model', () => {
                 _sessionType?: string,
                 _worktreeName?: string,
                 _resumeSessionId?: string,
-                _importHistory?: boolean,
                 _effort?: string,
                 _permissionMode?: string,
                 _serviceTier?: string,
@@ -1426,7 +1425,6 @@ describe('session model', () => {
                 _sessionType?: string,
                 _worktreeName?: string,
                 _resumeSessionId?: string,
-                _importHistory?: boolean,
                 _effort?: string,
                 _permissionMode?: string,
                 _serviceTier?: string,
-- 
2.39.5
